# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example demonstrates how to use `qiskit-serverless` tools to create a "
"parallel transpilation program, and then implement `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to "
"upload your program to IBM Quantum Platform to use as a reusable remote "
"service.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cet exemple montre comment utiliser les outils `qiskit-serverless` pour "
"créer un programme de transpilation parallèle, puis utiliser `qiskit-ibm-"
"catalog` pour téléverser ton programme sur IBM Quantum Platform et "
"l'utiliser comme service distant réutilisable.\n"

