msgstr "Vue d'ensemble du workflow {#workflow-overview}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create a local directory and empty program file "
"(`./source_files/transpile_remote.py`)\n"
msgstr ""
"Créer un répertoire local et un fichier de programme vide "
"(`./source_files/transpile_remote.py`)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Add code to your program that, when uploaded to Qiskit Serverless, will "
"transpile a circuit\n"
msgstr ""
"Ajouter du code à ton programme qui, une fois téléversé dans Qiskit "
"Serverless, transpilera un circuit\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to authenticate to Qiskit Serverless\n"
msgstr "Utiliser `qiskit-ibm-catalog` pour s'authentifier à Qiskit Serverless\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Upload the program to Qiskit Serverless\n"
msgstr "Téléverser le programme dans Qiskit Serverless\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After uploading your program , you can run it to transpile the circuit by "
"following the [Run your first Qiskit Serverless workload "
"remotely](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload) guide.\n"
msgstr ""
"Après avoir téléversé ton programme, tu pourras l'exécuter pour transpiler "
"le circuit en suivant le guide [Exécuter ta première charge de travail "
"Qiskit Serverless à distance](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload).\n"

