# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate to Qiskit Serverless {#authenticate-to-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr ""
"S'authentifier à Qiskit Serverless {#authenticate-to-qiskit-serverless}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to authenticate to `QiskitServerless` with your API"
" key (you can use your `QiskitRuntimeService` API key, or create a new API "
"key on the [IBM Quantum Platform "
"dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com)).\n"
msgstr ""
"Utilise `qiskit-ibm-catalog` pour t'authentifier à `QiskitServerless` avec "
"ta clé API (tu peux utiliser ta clé API `QiskitRuntimeService` ou en créer "
"une nouvelle sur le [tableau de bord IBM Quantum "
"Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com)).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run code to upload {#run-code-to-upload}"
msgstr "Exécuter le code pour téléverser {#run-code-to-upload}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run the following code to upload the program. Qiskit Serverless compresses "
"the contents of `working_dir` (in this case, `source_files`) into a `tar`, "
"which is uploaded and then cleaned up. The `entrypoint` identifies the main "
"program executable for Qiskit Serverless to run.\n"
msgstr ""
"Exécute le code suivant pour téléverser le programme. Qiskit Serverless "
"compresse le contenu de `working_dir` (dans ce cas, `source_files`) en un "
"fichier `tar`, qui est téléversé puis nettoyé. Le `entrypoint` identifie le "
"programme principal exécutable que Qiskit Serverless doit lancer.\n"

